Code Conversion Accuracy Report (Cursor IDE)
============================================

1. Frontend Frameworks (UI Layer)
---------------------------------
Angular → React            : 75–80% (Components/directives good; state mgmt. needs fixes)
React → Angular            : 65–70% (JSX → Templates harder)
Vue → React                : 70–75% (Templates → JSX okay; state mgmt. needs fixes)
jQuery → React/Angular/Vue : 40–50% (Heavy manual cleanup needed)
React Native → Flutter     : 30–40% (Basic UI converts, state mgmt. weak)

2. Backend Code (Server-Side)
-----------------------------
Java → C#                  : 80–85% (Reliable; OOP close)
C# → Java                  : 80–85% (High accuracy)
Python → Java              : 65–70% (Logic okay, libs differ)
Python → Node.js (JS/TS)   : 75–80% (APIs/scripts convert well)
PHP → Node.js              : 60–65% (Business logic okay, routing needs fixes)
C++ → Rust                 : 55–65% (Cursor handles basics, needs oversight)

3. Database Queries
-------------------
MySQL → PostgreSQL         : 75–85% (Tables fine; triggers need work)
PostgreSQL → MySQL         : 75–85% (Schema fine; advanced features differ)
SQL → NoSQL (MongoDB)      : 40–50% (Cursor drafts queries; schema manual)
SQL Optimization           : 80% (AI suggests rewrites & indexes)

4. Cross-Layer Conversions
--------------------------
Backend → Frontend API integration : 60–70% (Generates fetch/axios hooks well)
Frontend → Backend API service     : 40–50% (Needs business logic design)
Monolith → Microservices           : 35–50% (Scaffol
ding only, architecture manual)

5. Infrastructure & Config
--------------------------
YAML ↔ JSON ↔ HCL (Terraform)      : 85–90% (Very accurate data transformation)
Terraform → Pulumi (TS/Python)     : 60–70% (Basic infra fine; advanced manual)
Docker Compose → Kubernetes YAML   : 75–80% (Good, networking needs edits)

6. Legacy → Modern
------------------
COBOL → Java/Python        : 30–40% (Logic only, needs re-architecture)
Perl → Python              : 50–60% (Regex-heavy code cleanup needed)
VB6 → C#/Java              : 30–40% (UI/business layers need rewriting)

Summary
-------
High Accuracy (75–90%)   : Angular → React, Java ↔ C#, SQL ↔ SQL, YAML ↔ JSON
Medium Accuracy (55–75%) : Python ↔ Java/Node, PHP ↔ Node, C++ ↔ Rust, Terraform ↔ Pulumi
Low Accuracy (30–50%)    : Legacy → Modern, React Native ↔ Flutter, SQL → NoSQL
